+// `tasks_card/test_helpers.rs` (its `card()` helper goes through `AgentPanel::tasks_card()`).
+//
+// Contract assumed beyond design.md: `TaskActivity` has exactly the two variants
+// `Started(TaskRecord)` and `Ended(TaskRecord)`; `TaskRecord` (design.md's fields) derives
+// `Clone` + `Debug`; `TasksCard::live_task(&self, &acp_v2::SessionId, &AgentTaskId, &App)
+// -> Option<AgentTask>`; closing a thread is `sync_threads` without its view (story 013).
